{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00196","headline":"丰年多庆九日示怀 · 德宗皇帝","name":"丰年多庆九日示怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"爽气肃时令，早衣闻朔鸿。\n重阳有佳节，具物欣年丰。\n皎洁暮潭色，芬敷新菊丛。\n芳尊满衢室，繁吹凝烟空。\n惠合信吾道，保和惟尔同。\n推诚至玄化，天下期爲公。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"德宗皇帝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00196.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00196","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}